<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Copy for Photo estimate (0.2, behind release.photo): the logger's Photo chip
  and the sheet it opens. Design v3 3.7 (logger-photo.png) has the review
  lines; the rest is in docs/plans/screens/photo.md. No line names a number
  apart from the energy the policy formats, so every mode shows the words
  unchanged. Same rules as strings.xml: no backslash escapes, positional
  %1$s arguments.
-->
